{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54884","headline":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 三十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵行（辛本、川本、京本作「屯」）次，狸走入其中。\n不住夜鸣围绕寨，先因风火事（京本作「忧风火夜」）重重，埋伏且藏兵（京本作「踪」、辛本、川本作「拟藏中」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}